From t.jombart at imperial.ac.uk  Thu Jun 16 17:50:29 2011
From: t.jombart at imperial.ac.uk (Jombart, Thibaut)
Date: Thu, 16 Jun 2011 15:50:29 +0000
Subject: [adegenet-forum] DAPC/sPCA. Over-parameterization issues?
In-Reply-To: <1308236514.4dfa1ae2d431b@webmail.usask.ca>
References: <4DF08A61.6010200@gmail.com>
